# NAME: BandwidthTest
# PURPOSE: nPerf + TestMy.net + Cloudflare Speed Test
# NOTE:
# - nPerf control/API traffic uses nperf.com; test servers use dynamic *.nperf.net FQDNs.
# - Do not pin nPerf server IPs: server selection is dynamic and globally distributed.
# - TestMy.net test/mirror hosts remain under testmy.net.
# - Cloudflare Internet Speed Test uses speed.cloudflare.com; packet-loss TURN uses turn.cloudflare.com.
HOST-SUFFIX,nperf.com,带宽测速
HOST-SUFFIX,nperf.net,带宽测速
HOST-SUFFIX,testmy.net,带宽测速
HOST,speed.cloudflare.com,带宽测速
HOST,turn.cloudflare.com,带宽测速
